<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Evaluating combination expressions using factorials</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><b>(a)</b> Evaluate \({}_{{@pn1@}}C_{{@pr1@}}\).</p>
<p>\({}_{{@pn1@}}C_{{@pr1@}} =\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>

<p><b>(b)</b> Evaluate \({}_{{@pn2@}}C_{{@pr2@}}\).</p>
<p>\({}_{{@pn2@}}C_{{@pr2@}} =\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><b>Worked Solution:</b></p>

<p>Use the combination formula:</p>
<p style="margin-left: 20px;">\(\displaystyle {}_nC_r = \frac{n!}{r!(n - r)!}\)</p>

<p><b>Part (a): Evaluating \({}_{{@pn1@}}C_{{@pr1@}}\)</b><br>
Substitute \(n = {@pn1@}\) and \(r = {@pr1@}\), simplify \(({@pn1@} - {@pr1@})! = {@rem1@}!\), expand \({@pn1@}!\) down to \({@rem1@}!\), and cancel \({@rem1@}!\):</p>
<p style="margin-left: 20px;">\(\displaystyle {}_{{@pn1@}}C_{{@pr1@}} = \frac{{@pn1@}!}{{@pr1@}!\,({@pn1@} - {@pr1@})!} = \frac{{@pn1@}!}{{@pr1@}!\,{@rem1@}!} = \frac{{@num1_factors@} \times {@rem1@}!}{({@den1_factors@}) \times {@rem1@}!} = \frac{{@num1_factors@}}{{@den1_factors@}} = \frac{{@num1_prod@}}{{@den1_prod@}} = {@ta1@}\)</p>
<p style="margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.2em;">\(\displaystyle \boxed{ {}_{{@pn1@}}C_{{@pr1@}} = {@ta1@} }\)</p>

<p><b>Part (b): Evaluating \({}_{{@pn2@}}C_{{@pr2@}}\)</b><br>
Substitute \(n = {@pn2@}\) and \(r = {@pr2@}\), simplify \(({@pn2@} - {@pr2@})! = {@rem2@}!\), expand \({@pn2@}!\) down to \({@rem2@}!\), and cancel \({@rem2@}!\):</p>
<p style="margin-left: 20px;">\(\displaystyle {}_{{@pn2@}}C_{{@pr2@}} = \frac{{@pn2@}!}{{@pr2@}!\,({@pn2@} - {@pr2@})!} = \frac{{@pn2@}!}{{@pr2@}!\,{@rem2@}!} = \frac{{@num2_factors@} \times {@rem2@}!}{({@den2_factors@}) \times {@rem2@}!} = \frac{{@num2_factors@}}{{@den2_factors@}} = \frac{{@num2_prod@}}{{@den2_prod@}} = {@ta2@}\)</p>
<p style="margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.2em;">\(\displaystyle \boxed{ {}_{{@pn2@}}C_{{@pr2@}} = {@ta2@} }\)</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
